        "id": 11579,
        "name": "Braithwhite",
        "username": "Braithwhite",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-26T00:23:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One of the things I love about this game is the capacity it has to surprise me with things that I've never noticed in cards that I've looked at hundreds of times. &nbsp;I tend to theorize and speculate about the hidden clues far more than is healthy, so it was a joy to find something new that (as far as I know), no one else has noticed!</p><p>Take a look at the Chairman:</p><p>![](upload://oYqqlunOBT1V8CCzym1Yb9aKFwF.jpeg)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Take a closer look:</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>whoa. &nbsp;too close. &nbsp;</p><p>Pull back, and take a look to the left of him. &nbsp;Who is casting that shadow?</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>As far as I can tell, this is somebody new. &nbsp;Whoever it is has exposed (slightly sticky-uppy) hair and ears, as well as a slim physique and what look like armguards. &nbsp;Its a safe bet that I'll be looking for a match from now on!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-13T15:42:32.523Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
